    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1826">

                <pb facs="1334" n="1218" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1218"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 319.1123L25/23.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 675.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 11, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose a copy of
                    another note sent by me to the Panaman Foreign Office in continuation of my
                    efforts in the matter of the Colon riot of April 2nd.</p>
                <p>Señor Lefevre declared to me that he was going to take a day from his office on
                    Tuesday and spend it in conference with the Criminal Judge in an attempt to
                    further the investigations herein, <pb facs="1335" n="1219" xml:id="pg1219"/>
                    and that he would give me an early response. It has not been received.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Jennings Price.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1826-a1.xml" xpointer="d1826-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
